      "short_description": "Peak Power Inc is a North American cleantech company based in Toronto, Ontario, specializing in energy optimization software and turnkey energy storage solutions. Founded in 2015, the company has expanded its operations across the United States, with offices in New York, Boston, and California. Peak Power Inc focuses on leveraging advanced technologies like Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, and Big Data to tackle challenges in energy markets and the built environment.\n\nThe company's flagship product, Peak Synergy, is an AI-driven energy management platform that optimizes the use of battery energy storage systems, grid-interactive buildings, and electric vehicles. In addition to software, Peak Power Inc offers comprehensive energy storage solutions, including project development support, financing, installation, and the management of virtual power plants. The company serves large-scale commercial and industrial clients, helping them achieve sustainability goals and reduce operational costs. With a recent $35 million financing round to support its U.S. expansion, Peak Power Inc is positioned as a leader in the energy transition.",
